---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="BoredGamer Arena"
  description="Multiplayer Kingdomino and Partnership Pinochle server built with zero-copy Rust simulation engines, self-play reinforcement learning, sub-2ms ONNX CPU inference, and post-game AI replay analysis."
  canonicalPath="/projects/boredgamer-arena"
  category="Reinforcement Learning & Game AI"
  summary="Multiplayer board and card game lounge running on a 2-vCPU Proxmox container with no GPU. Combines zero-copy Rust bitboard simulation cores, self-play reinforcement learning, quantized ONNX CPU policies, and turn-by-turn post-game AI replay analysis."
  stack={['Rust · PyO3', 'ONNX Runtime CPU', 'IS-MCTS', 'FastAPI WebSockets', 'Proxmox LXC']}
  liveUrl="https://arena.eliburgessconsulting.com"
  liveLabel="Launch Arena Lounge ↗"
  secondaryUrl="https://arena.eliburgessconsulting.com/kingdomino/"
  secondaryLabel="Play Kingdomino ↗"
>
  <!-- Live Telemetry + Direct Game Launchers -->
  <section class="studio-panel arena-console" aria-labelledby="arena-console-heading">
    <div class="console-top">
      <div class="console-heading-group">
        <span class="spec-label">Live Lobby &amp; Direct Table Launchers</span>
        <h2 id="arena-console-heading" class="console-title">Arena Cluster Status</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-indicator mono" id="arena-live-pill" title="Querying /api/arena/status">
        <span class="status-dot" id="arena-pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span id="arena-pill-label">Checking lobby...</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-strip" role="region" aria-label="Live server metrics">
      <div class="telemetry-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Service</span>
        <strong class="telemetry-val mono" id="kpi-status">Standby</strong>
        <span class="telemetry-sub mono" id="kpi-ping">CT 105 · WebSocket</span>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Active Tables</span>
        <strong class="telemetry-val mono" id="kpi-tables">0</strong>
        <span class="telemetry-sub mono" id="kpi-tables-sub">0 playing · 0 waiting</span>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Connected Clients</span>
        <strong class="telemetry-val mono" id="kpi-players">0</strong>
        <span class="telemetry-sub mono" id="kpi-players-sub">0 seated · 0 spectators</span>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Kingdomino Bots</span>
        <strong class="telemetry-val mono" id="kpi-kingdomino-bots">12</strong>
        <span class="telemetry-sub mono">baron_* ONNX &amp; MCTS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Pinochle Bots</span>
        <strong class="telemetry-val mono" id="kpi-pinochle-bots">5</strong>
        <span class="telemetry-sub mono">master_4p &amp; IS-MCTS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="launchers-grid">
      <div class="launcher-card">
        <div class="launcher-meta mono">2–4 Players · 5×5 &amp; 7×7 · Post-Game AI Replay</div>
        <h3 class="launcher-name">Kingdomino AI</h3>
        <p class="launcher-desc">
          Territory drafting against calibrated bots up to <code>baron_*</code> Siamese ResNet ONNX policies, with custom flag/crest castle markers, a single-line AI win-likelihood hover graph, and step-by-step post-game replay with AI move reasoning.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://arena.eliburgessconsulting.com/kingdomino/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-primary btn-sm"
        >
          Launch Kingdomino ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="launcher-card">
        <div class="launcher-meta mono">4 Players · 48-Card Deck · 5 Bot Tiers</div>
        <h3 class="launcher-name">Partnership Pinochle AI</h3>
        <p class="launcher-desc">
          Imperfect-information trick-taking with partner bidding, meld declarations, belief-consistent IS-MCTS determinization, and the <code>master_4p</code> ONNX policy-value network.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://arena.eliburgessconsulting.com/pinochle/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"
        >
          Launch Partnership Pinochle ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture Narrative + Spec Grid -->
  <section aria-labelledby="arch-heading" class="section-stack">
    <div class="prose-block">
      <span class="spec-label">Architecture</span>
      <h2 id="arch-heading">CPU-First Simulation &amp; Neural Inference</h2>
      <p>
        Serving low-latency neural bots across concurrent multiplayer tables on a 2-vCPU, 2 GB RAM container requires keeping Python out of the inner search loop. Core rules for both games live in native Rust crates (<code>kingdomino_py</code> and <code>pinochle_py</code>) backed by 64-bit bitboards and exposed via PyO3, reaching 25,000+ rollouts per second per core with zero GIL contention.
      </p>
      <p>
        Policies are trained offline via self-play and league masked PPO in PyTorch, then exported to quantized ONNX graphs (<code>torch_imported: false</code> in production). Removing PyTorch from the web worker cuts container RAM from ~1.9 GB to 240 MB while evaluating board states in under 1.8 ms on CPU.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spec-grid">
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">01 / Native Engine</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">Zero-Copy Rust + PyO3</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Bitboard legal-move masks and state clones run at 25k+ rollouts/s per core without JSON or buffer serialization.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">02 / Inference</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">ONNX CPU Runtime</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">17 exported policy/value models run on <code>CPUExecutionProvider</code> in &lt;1.8 ms inside a 240 MB RAM budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">03 / Hidden State</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">Constrained IS-MCTS</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Samples hidden opponent hands consistent with auction bids, public melds, and revealed suit voids before search.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">04 / Deployment</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">Proxmox CT 105</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Async FastAPI WebSocket rooms fronted by Cloudflare Tunnel TLS with zero exposed router ports.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bot Tier Roster -->
  <section class="studio-panel" aria-labelledby="roster-heading">
    <div class="roster-head">
      <span class="spec-label">Model Catalog</span>
      <h2 id="roster-heading" class="console-title">Calibrated Bot Tiers</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="roster-tables">
      <div>
        <h3 class="roster-subtitle mono">Kingdomino (Glicko-2 &amp; Policy Architecture)</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="studio-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Bot</th>
                <th scope="col">Architecture</th>
                <th scope="col" class="num">Rating / Budget</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Jester / Squire</strong></td>
                <td>Random baseline &amp; Rust territory/denial heuristic</td>
                <td class="mono num">~400–1000 · &lt;0.1ms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Knight</strong></td>
                <td>400-simulation determinized Rust PUCT MCTS</td>
                <td class="mono num">~1390 · Rust MCTS</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Baron (<code>baron_*</code>)</strong></td>
                <td>Siamese ResNet ONNX (2P, 2–4P &amp; 7×7 masked PPO)</td>
                <td class="mono num">~1500 · &lt;2ms CPU</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Grandmaster</strong></td>
                <td><code>baron_*</code> policy + CRN world sampling &amp; exact endgame</td>
                <td class="mono num">~1690 · 70–500ms</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="roster-subtitle mono">Partnership Pinochle (Search &amp; Latency)</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="studio-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Bot</th>
                <th scope="col">Architecture</th>
                <th scope="col" class="num">Latency</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Apprentice / Sharp</strong></td>
                <td>Rule opener, Ace/10 counter &amp; partner void tracker</td>
                <td class="mono num">&lt;0.25ms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Tactician</strong></td>
                <td>Belief-consistent IS-MCTS over meld &amp; void constraints</td>
                <td class="mono num">&lt;1.0ms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Master (<code>master_4p</code>)</strong></td>
                <td>Partnership policy-value ONNX net (250k teacher hands + PPO)</td>
                <td class="mono num">&lt;2.0ms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Grandmaster</strong></td>
                <td><code>master_4p</code> ONNX + 32-world search &amp; 4-trick solver</td>
                <td class="mono num">60–110ms</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ProjectLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function initArenaTelemetry() {
    var pillDot = document.getElementById('arena-pill-dot');
    var pillLabel = document.getElementById('arena-pill-label');
    var kpiStatus = document.getElementById('kpi-status');
    var kpiPing = document.getElementById('kpi-ping');
    var kpiTables = document.getElementById('kpi-tables');
    var kpiTablesSub = document.getElementById('kpi-tables-sub');
    var kpiPlayers = document.getElementById('kpi-players');
    var kpiPlayersSub = document.getElementById('kpi-players-sub');
    var kpiKingdomino = document.getElementById('kpi-kingdomino-bots');
    var kpiPinochle = document.getElementById('kpi-pinochle-bots');

    var apiBase = window.__API_BASE__ || 'https://api.eliburgessconsulting.com';
    var isPolling = false;

    function fetchArenaStatus() {
      if (isPolling) return;
      isPolling = true;

      var controller = typeof AbortController !== 'undefined' ? new AbortController() : null;
      var timeoutId = controller
        ? setTimeout(function () {
            controller.abort();
          }, 3500)
        : null;

      var started = Date.now();

      fetch(apiBase + '/api/arena/status', {
        method: 'GET',
        headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
        signal: controller ? controller.signal : undefined,
      })
        .then(function (res) {
          if (timeoutId) clearTimeout(timeoutId);
          if (!res.ok) throw new Error('HTTP ' + res.status);
          return res.json();
        })
        .then(function (data) {
          var rtt = Date.now() - started;
          var online = Boolean(data && (data.online === true || data.status === 'ok' || data.status === 'online'));

          if (pillDot) pillDot.className = online ? 'status-dot is-online' : 'status-dot';
          if (pillLabel) pillLabel.textContent = online ? 'Online · ' + rtt + 'ms' : 'Standby · Static Spec';

          if (kpiStatus) kpiStatus.textContent = online ? 'Online' : 'Standby';
          if (kpiPing) kpiPing.textContent = online ? 'CT 105 · ' + rtt + 'ms RTT' : 'Standby snapshot';

          if (kpiKingdomino && data.kingdomino_bots !== undefined) {
            kpiKingdomino.textContent = String(data.kingdomino_bots);
          }
          if (kpiPinochle && data.pinochle_bots !== undefined) {
            kpiPinochle.textContent = String(data.pinochle_bots);
          }

          var activeTables = Number(data.active_tables || 0);
          var playingTables = Number(data.playing_tables || 0);
          if (kpiTables) kpiTables.textContent = String(activeTables);
          if (kpiTablesSub) {
            kpiTablesSub.textContent =
              playingTables + ' playing · ' + Math.max(0, activeTables - playingTables) + ' waiting';
          }

          var activePlayers = Number(data.active_players || 0);
          if (kpiPlayers) kpiPlayers.textContent = String(activePlayers);
          if (kpiPlayersSub) {
            kpiPlayersSub.textContent =
              Number(data.seated_humans || 0) + ' seated · ' + Number(data.spectators || 0) + ' spectators';
          }
        })
        .catch(function () {
          if (timeoutId) clearTimeout(timeoutId);
          if (pillDot) pillDot.className = 'status-dot';
          if (pillLabel) pillLabel.textContent = 'Standby · Static Spec';
          if (kpiStatus) kpiStatus.textContent = 'Standby';
          if (kpiPing) kpiPing.textContent = 'Offline fallback';
        })
        .finally(function () {
          isPolling = false;
        });
    }

    fetchArenaStatus();
    setInterval(function () {
      if (!document.hidden) fetchArenaStatus();
    }, 15000);
    document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', function () {
      if (!document.hidden) fetchArenaStatus();
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .section-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .arena-console {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .console-top,
  .roster-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .console-heading-group,
  .roster-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .console-top {
    flex-direction: row;
  }

  .console-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .telemetry-indicator {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 0.38rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--text-muted);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .status-dot.is-online {
    background: var(--live-dot);
  }

  .telemetry-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .telemetry-cell {
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .telemetry-val {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .telemetry-sub {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .launchers-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .launcher-card {
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.35rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .launcher-meta {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .launcher-name {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .launcher-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .launcher-desc code,
  .spec-text code,
  .prose-block code,
  .studio-table code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .roster-tables {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .roster-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .studio-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .studio-table th,
  .studio-table td {
    padding: 0.68rem 0.85rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .studio-table th {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .studio-table td {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .studio-table td strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .studio-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .studio-table .num {
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .telemetry-strip {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .roster-tables {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .telemetry-strip {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .launchers-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .telemetry-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
